solution_md:
\begin{align*}
\int_{1}^{e}\frac{2x^{2}+1}{x^{3}+x\log\left(x\right)}dx
&=\int_{1}^{e}\frac{2x+\frac{1}{x}}{x^{2}+\log\left(x\right)}dx 
&=\log\left(x^{2}+\log\left(x\right)\right)\  \Big \vert_{1}^{e} 
&= \boxed{\log(e^2+1)}
\end{align*}

