However, these numbers can only present as double of 32^2, (double of 512 or square of 32) and double of 256 , respectively   

Because of this, Ava wouldn’t have offered these options to Brianna preemptively, so we can strike 32^2, 32, 512 and 256 from Ava possible offerings, but on the other hand, what Ava herself initially gets depends on the previous opponents’ and also teammates’ choices , while she only can make her own decision on how to expand on the passed over interim C  

